	(text "USB-C, 5 V only (spec 2): 5.1k on CC1/CC2 (sink), USBLC6-2SC6 at the connector.\nD+/D- go straight to USB_D+/USB_D- (the 27R series resistors are on the MCU sheet). VBUS goes to the priority diode."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
